From: Andy Chiang <AndyChiang_git@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 22:50:48 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] skip copy nested binaries

OpenWrt packages containerd, runc, tini, and the other Docker runtime
components separately. Copying executables from the build host into the
dockerd bundle is unnecessary and fails on GitHub runners when one of the
expected host executables is absent.

---
 hack/make/binary-daemon | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/hack/make/binary-daemon
+++ b/hack/make/binary-daemon
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 set -e
 
 copy_binaries() {
+	return
	local dir="${1:?}"

	# Add nested executables to bundle dir so we have complete set of
